WEBVTT

00:31.550 --> 00:35.100
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.120 --> 00:38.500
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.770 --> 00:44.740
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.900 --> 00:49.530
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.550 --> 00:53.060
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.080 --> 00:56.570
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.590 --> 01:00.100
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.120 --> 01:06.180
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.440 --> 01:23.720
Si Jin

01:23.740 --> 01:27.720
Episode 6

01:27.720 --> 01:32.120
(Earl Dongping's Mansion, Jiang)

01:38.940 --> 01:40.530
I'll be gentle.

01:40.550 --> 01:42.270
Just hold on a bit, Qian.

01:44.580 --> 01:45.940
Mother,

01:46.510 --> 01:49.000
Father has gone to Concubine Ruan's.

01:49.020 --> 01:50.740
Go wherever he likes.

01:50.940 --> 01:52.790
He'd better die in that wench's room.

01:52.790 --> 01:54.460
This heartless creature

01:54.460 --> 01:56.520
cares only for his political climb,

01:56.540 --> 01:59.150
discarding even his own daughter.

01:59.380 --> 02:00.740
Mother,

02:01.140 --> 02:02.670
you know what?

02:03.510 --> 02:05.860
I suddenly envy the First Branch.

02:05.910 --> 02:07.140
Ji Chongyi only pushed Jiang Si

02:07.140 --> 02:09.080
into the river by accident,

02:09.100 --> 02:10.740
without even injuring her,

02:11.420 --> 02:13.430
yet my uncle risked everything

02:13.590 --> 02:14.590
to annul her engagement

02:14.590 --> 02:16.550
and filed charges with the Capital Security.

02:16.910 --> 02:19.300
If it had been Jiang Si today,

02:19.790 --> 02:21.490
my uncle would've grabbed a knife

02:21.510 --> 02:23.740
to confront the Cao Family.

02:23.820 --> 02:25.100
If Father showed

02:25.100 --> 02:27.390
half his brother's care for his daughter,

02:27.980 --> 02:29.510
perhaps Cao Xingyu

02:30.030 --> 02:31.860
wouldn't dare treat me this way.

02:33.910 --> 02:35.390
Qian,

02:36.100 --> 02:37.580
it was my fault

02:38.870 --> 02:41.710
for planning your marriage.

02:43.790 --> 02:45.640
I've ruined your life!

02:45.660 --> 02:48.180
Mother, what are you doing? Mother!

02:52.750 --> 02:54.080
It seems that

02:54.100 --> 02:55.490
marrying up

02:55.510 --> 02:57.300
isn't necessarily a blessing.

02:57.630 --> 02:59.330
You've finally seen the light, Pei.

02:59.350 --> 03:01.170
I've always envied Qian

03:01.190 --> 03:02.860
since childhood,

03:03.220 --> 03:04.770
not expecting

03:04.790 --> 03:05.910
that her life

03:05.910 --> 03:07.360
is a living hell.

03:07.380 --> 03:08.740
No more.

03:08.790 --> 03:09.650
I'll stop obsessing

03:09.650 --> 03:12.290
over aristocratic marriages.

03:12.310 --> 03:14.580
I'll aim for civilian officials' families,

03:14.700 --> 03:17.520
men who can't lift weights

03:17.540 --> 03:18.610
or wield tools,

03:18.630 --> 03:20.360
only writing brushes.

03:20.380 --> 03:22.200
At least they won't beat me.

03:22.220 --> 03:23.780
Yes, yes.

03:25.910 --> 03:27.270
Mother,

03:27.350 --> 03:28.910
I know you meant well

03:28.910 --> 03:31.020
for my future.

03:32.790 --> 03:35.340
You're the only one who truly loves me.

03:35.660 --> 03:36.630
Grandma and Father

03:36.630 --> 03:38.780
would never risk so much

03:39.030 --> 03:41.300
to protect me like you do.

03:42.700 --> 03:44.830
My poor child.

03:45.030 --> 03:48.710
You are the flesh of my flesh,

03:48.790 --> 03:50.850
the child I carried for ten months.

03:50.870 --> 03:53.150
Every blow on you

03:53.470 --> 03:55.220
cuts deeper

03:55.220 --> 03:56.190
than on me.

03:56.190 --> 03:58.060
Mother, Mother.

03:58.870 --> 04:00.270
I don't blame you.

04:00.350 --> 04:01.920
It's my fault.

04:01.940 --> 04:03.900
My fault.

04:04.260 --> 04:05.240
Ma'am,

04:05.260 --> 04:07.560
please don't send Miss Qian back.

04:07.580 --> 04:10.100
She might really be beaten to death.

04:14.070 --> 04:15.430
Qian,

04:16.670 --> 04:18.030
don't worry.

04:18.510 --> 04:21.090
Even if I have to risk my life,

04:21.110 --> 04:23.340
I will protect you.

04:24.510 --> 04:25.780
I won't let you

04:25.780 --> 04:28.410
suffer like this anymore.

04:28.430 --> 04:30.310
Mother!

04:35.990 --> 04:37.090
Who is it?

04:37.110 --> 04:38.780
I have an idea.

04:39.310 --> 04:40.530
Nonsense!

04:40.550 --> 04:43.000
I thought you had a good idea,

04:43.020 --> 04:44.630
but you could get Qian killed.

04:44.630 --> 04:46.360
Didn't Qian say

04:46.380 --> 04:48.260
she would do anything to escape

04:48.260 --> 04:49.410
that beast's torment?

04:49.430 --> 04:50.800
Reporting him now

04:50.820 --> 04:52.920
is her best chance to break free.

04:52.940 --> 04:54.490
As you said,

04:54.510 --> 04:55.820
if Qian testifies against Cao Xingyu

04:55.820 --> 04:57.050
at the Capital Security Office,

04:57.070 --> 04:58.800
what will Marquis Changxing do?

04:58.820 --> 05:00.140
Will he let her go?

05:00.140 --> 05:02.610
Does she have any other way out?

05:02.630 --> 05:04.510
If she goes back, she'll live in fear,

05:04.510 --> 05:05.550
daily beatings, abuse,

05:05.550 --> 05:07.170
maybe snuffed out tomorrow.

05:07.190 --> 05:09.140
Cao Xingyu can claim she died of illness,

05:09.140 --> 05:11.120
and wipe out the traces.

05:11.140 --> 05:12.990
What can we do then?

05:12.990 --> 05:14.070
Uncle has made

05:14.070 --> 05:15.240
his attitude clear tonight.

05:15.260 --> 05:16.880
He would never step in.

05:16.900 --> 05:17.900
Aunt, Qian,

05:17.900 --> 05:19.090
the two of you

05:19.110 --> 05:21.120
are powerless to file for divorce.

05:21.140 --> 05:22.580
I'm not going.

05:22.840 --> 05:24.340
If I report to the authorities,

05:24.580 --> 05:26.070
Cao Xingyu has 100 ways

05:26.070 --> 05:28.000
to make my life a living hell.

05:28.020 --> 05:29.120
Jiang Si,

05:29.140 --> 05:30.190
I had no choice

05:30.190 --> 05:32.290
but to invite you to the mansion.

05:32.310 --> 05:34.440
Do you hate me that much?

05:34.460 --> 05:36.680
Fighters bleed, watchers feed.

05:36.700 --> 05:38.440
You're fanning flames

05:38.460 --> 05:39.700
just to use me as your tool

05:39.700 --> 05:41.240
for vengeance.

05:41.260 --> 05:43.110
If I stay silent, I can at least survive.

05:43.110 --> 05:44.560
Survive, seriously?

05:44.580 --> 05:47.070
You're just sitting here waiting to die.

05:49.160 --> 05:50.230
The depth of the ligature marks

05:50.230 --> 05:51.380
on the victims' necks

05:51.380 --> 05:52.220
indicates

05:52.220 --> 05:52.940
that all the women

05:52.940 --> 05:54.340
(Capital Security)
were strangled to death

05:54.340 --> 05:55.900
by the same guy using a cord-like object.

05:55.900 --> 05:57.670
Any other leads?

05:57.670 --> 05:59.150
Not yet.

06:05.260 --> 06:07.950
Why are her marks different?

06:08.340 --> 06:10.700
Either because of her special constitution

06:10.700 --> 06:12.170
or she was struggling too hard

06:12.190 --> 06:13.800
when she was about to die.

06:13.820 --> 06:16.460
It's hard to tell from the body.

06:20.230 --> 06:21.550
See if there's anything

06:21.550 --> 06:22.580
in her throat.

06:22.580 --> 06:23.940
Yes.

06:30.460 --> 06:31.340
Look, sir.

06:31.340 --> 06:32.700
This is

06:32.820 --> 06:34.270
a button.

06:41.070 --> 06:42.830
Did Yu Qi

06:43.110 --> 06:44.610
really say that?

06:44.630 --> 06:45.780
Absolutely true.

06:45.780 --> 06:46.780
He said Anzi

06:46.780 --> 06:48.140
couldn't afford that thing.

06:48.140 --> 06:51.100
He'd summon you for questioning.

06:57.340 --> 06:58.700
Really?

07:05.230 --> 07:07.100
Anzi couldn't afford it,

07:07.990 --> 07:10.270
but someone else can.

07:12.630 --> 07:14.190
Your Honor,

07:14.430 --> 07:16.260
I'm here today

07:16.260 --> 07:18.530
to tell you something important.

07:18.550 --> 07:20.780
After Anzi confessed,

07:20.780 --> 07:22.440
I felt something was wrong.

07:22.460 --> 07:23.460
He was always

07:23.460 --> 07:25.240
honest and law-abiding.

07:25.260 --> 07:26.870
How could he have had the nerve

07:26.870 --> 07:28.750
to kill those women and bury their bodies?

07:30.990 --> 07:32.430
You testified

07:32.430 --> 07:34.020
against him,

07:34.020 --> 07:35.920
and your father executed him.

07:35.940 --> 07:37.300
Now what?

07:37.750 --> 07:39.650
Are you going to

07:39.670 --> 07:41.920
change your tune?

07:41.940 --> 07:45.780
You really treat lives like weeds.

07:48.230 --> 07:49.730
His death

07:49.750 --> 07:50.920
wasn't undeserved.

07:50.940 --> 07:52.110
My father

07:52.110 --> 07:53.780
did it fair.

07:54.580 --> 07:57.360
But my investigation of the household

07:57.380 --> 08:01.340
revealed Anzi wasn't the mastermind,

08:02.430 --> 08:04.310
just an accomplice.

08:06.040 --> 08:09.000
(Upright and Fair)

08:09.020 --> 08:10.850
Based on what you've said,

08:10.870 --> 08:12.830
who's the mastermind?

08:18.380 --> 08:19.950
It's no one else

08:20.190 --> 08:22.110
but my wife,

08:22.420 --> 08:23.820
Jiang Qian.

08:29.260 --> 08:30.620
Stop barking.

08:32.400 --> 08:34.490
(Warrant for Apprehension)

08:34.510 --> 08:36.900
Did Cao Xingyu

08:37.140 --> 08:39.040
- sue Qian in court?
- Yes.

08:39.060 --> 08:40.610
He testified against Jiang Qian

08:40.630 --> 08:42.660
as the mastermind of the murder.

08:42.680 --> 08:43.540
Miss.

08:43.540 --> 08:45.000
Qian, Qian.

08:45.020 --> 08:46.540
The villains sue first.

08:46.540 --> 08:47.540
How outrageous!

08:47.540 --> 08:48.850
Mrs. Cao,

08:48.870 --> 08:49.990
please come with us.

08:49.990 --> 08:51.510
Si was right.

08:51.530 --> 08:52.540
I should have listened to her

08:52.540 --> 08:54.350
and testified against Cao Xingyu.

08:54.540 --> 08:56.350
Mother, what should I do?

08:56.350 --> 08:57.210
Qian, don't be afraid.

08:57.230 --> 08:58.830
- Don't go. You mustn't go.
- Take her away!

08:58.830 --> 08:59.950
What are you doing?

08:59.970 --> 09:00.830
- Miss!
- Stop it!

09:00.830 --> 09:01.670
- Miss!
- Qian!

09:01.680 --> 09:02.580
Go find Jiang Si.

09:02.580 --> 09:03.630
She's the only one who can help me.

09:03.630 --> 09:04.760
Mother!

09:04.780 --> 09:06.300
Let go!

09:07.320 --> 09:10.610
(Capital Security Office)

09:10.630 --> 09:12.280
It's time for you

09:12.300 --> 09:13.730
to confess.

09:13.750 --> 09:15.970
You had an affair with Anzi.

09:15.990 --> 09:17.300
Seeing him get close

09:17.300 --> 09:18.570
to those women,

09:18.590 --> 09:20.000
you became jealous.

09:20.020 --> 09:21.470
So you ordered him

09:21.470 --> 09:22.830
to torture and kill them.

09:22.830 --> 09:24.760
What a family disgrace!

09:24.780 --> 09:25.930
You're lying.

09:25.950 --> 09:27.310
I didn't!

09:27.350 --> 09:28.380
I had never seen

09:28.380 --> 09:29.570
those women.

09:29.590 --> 09:31.300
How could I possibly kill them?

09:31.590 --> 09:33.350
Your Honor, please discern the truth.

09:33.750 --> 09:35.900
Like the victims,

09:35.950 --> 09:38.360
I endured Cao Xingyu's daily beatings,

09:38.380 --> 09:40.640
but I was too terrified to testify.

09:40.660 --> 09:42.270
I never thought

09:42.470 --> 09:44.330
he would frame me instead.

09:44.350 --> 09:46.630
Your Honor, have her injuries examined.

09:46.630 --> 09:47.990
They match

09:47.990 --> 09:49.930
the victims' injuries exactly.

09:49.950 --> 09:51.400
But I have proof

09:51.420 --> 09:53.000
that this wicked woman

09:53.020 --> 09:54.610
had an affair with Anzi

09:54.630 --> 09:57.780
and ordered him to kill the victims.

10:01.140 --> 10:02.630
This is the button

10:02.630 --> 10:05.060
Jiang Qian left at Anzi's place.

10:08.060 --> 10:09.350
And this is the signed testimony

10:09.350 --> 10:10.990
from Anzi's wife,

10:10.990 --> 10:12.710
who witnessed their affair

10:12.710 --> 10:15.330
and murder plot.

10:15.350 --> 10:16.710
Present it.

10:17.780 --> 10:19.760
He's framing me.

10:19.780 --> 10:21.610
He grabbed a random button,

10:21.630 --> 10:23.330
threatened Anzi's family,

10:23.350 --> 10:24.510
and extorted false testimony,

10:24.510 --> 10:26.450
all to frame me, Your Honor.

10:26.470 --> 10:27.340
I saw Anzi

10:27.340 --> 10:28.570
burying the bodies that night.

10:28.590 --> 10:29.540
Also, my sister

10:29.540 --> 10:30.380
was sleeping

10:30.380 --> 10:32.120
in her room at that time.

10:32.140 --> 10:33.940
How could she be the mastermind?

10:34.300 --> 10:37.180
So it was you who reported it.

10:37.830 --> 10:38.760
Your Honor,

10:38.780 --> 10:40.610
they're real sisters.

10:40.630 --> 10:42.330
They must have feared exposure,

10:42.350 --> 10:44.180
so they pinned

10:44.180 --> 10:45.810
the case on me.

10:45.830 --> 10:48.630
Your Honor, you must see through this!

10:49.280 --> 10:51.280
(Jiang Qian had an affair with Anzi.)

10:55.630 --> 10:56.990
Bring the witness.

10:57.120 --> 10:58.900
Summon the witness.

11:03.590 --> 11:05.820
Your Honor, the witness is here.

11:06.870 --> 11:08.570
State your name.

11:08.590 --> 11:11.390
Your Honor, I'm Chi Shuying.

11:12.140 --> 11:13.540
I'm asking you,

11:14.420 --> 11:17.420
do you know the Jiang sisters?

11:17.780 --> 11:19.520
I have nothing to do

11:19.540 --> 11:21.020
with them.

11:21.140 --> 11:24.330
Then do you know

11:24.350 --> 11:25.400
Cao Xingyu?

11:25.420 --> 11:26.820
Your Honor,

11:26.870 --> 11:28.230
I know him.

11:28.380 --> 11:29.640
I was lured by this scoundrel

11:29.660 --> 11:31.330
to Marquis Changxing's Mansion,

11:31.350 --> 11:32.690
imprisoned in the western yard,

11:32.710 --> 11:34.640
and suffered daily abuse and humiliation.

11:34.660 --> 11:35.610
I...

11:35.630 --> 11:37.230
I saw this beast kill someone.

11:37.230 --> 11:38.820
You liar!

11:38.840 --> 11:39.690
Come back!

11:39.700 --> 11:41.940
Your Honor, she seduced me,

11:41.940 --> 11:43.260
asking me to abandon my wife and marry her.

11:43.260 --> 11:45.260
I refused, so she turned on me.

11:45.260 --> 11:47.300
Your Honor, my injuries

11:47.300 --> 11:48.900
are proof of that.

11:56.540 --> 11:57.570
Miss Chi,

11:57.590 --> 12:00.090
you said you saw Cao Xingyu kill someone.

12:00.110 --> 12:03.230
What weapon did he use?

12:03.350 --> 12:04.610
Your Honor,

12:04.630 --> 12:06.110
a horsewhip.

12:06.230 --> 12:08.520
Run! Dare you still run?

12:08.540 --> 12:11.020
Is it exciting?

12:11.630 --> 12:12.510
She's only saying this

12:12.510 --> 12:14.570
to frame me.

12:14.590 --> 12:16.210
Don't believe her.

12:16.230 --> 12:18.470
I will try this case

12:18.470 --> 12:20.110
with impartiality and rigor.

12:20.510 --> 12:22.160
Do you know

12:22.180 --> 12:23.810
where the weapon is?

12:23.830 --> 12:25.300
It's in Marquis Changxing's Mansion.

12:25.300 --> 12:26.660
Miss Chi!

12:27.420 --> 12:30.180
Think twice about what you say.

12:30.540 --> 12:32.570
I'm the heir to Marquis Changxing.

12:32.590 --> 12:35.610
How dare you slander me with baseless claims?

12:35.630 --> 12:38.020
Regardless of your status,

12:38.660 --> 12:41.390
you are not permitted

12:41.510 --> 12:43.040
to act insolently in this court.

12:43.060 --> 12:44.420
Miss Chi,

12:44.630 --> 12:45.640
don't be afraid.

12:45.660 --> 12:46.590
Proceed.

12:46.610 --> 12:48.140
Everything I've said is true.

12:48.140 --> 12:49.780
The murder weapon is in the mansion...

12:49.780 --> 12:51.300
Shut up!

12:51.870 --> 12:53.350
Miss Chi!

12:59.140 --> 13:00.630
Miss Chi!

13:06.870 --> 13:08.300
Long Dan!

13:08.380 --> 13:09.990
Mr. Yu!

13:10.540 --> 13:11.900
Are you alright?

13:13.260 --> 13:14.350
- Let go of me!
- Get up.

13:14.350 --> 13:16.040
- Let go.
- Cao Xingyu,

13:16.060 --> 13:18.120
you've got some nerve!

13:18.140 --> 13:19.380
How dare you

13:19.380 --> 13:20.930
attack the witness in my court?

13:20.950 --> 13:22.020
Take him away!

13:22.020 --> 13:23.420
I am the heir to Marquis Changxing.

13:23.420 --> 13:24.630
You dare lay a finger on me?

13:24.630 --> 13:26.020
Long Dan!

13:26.510 --> 13:28.380
Take him to prison to await sentencing.

13:28.380 --> 13:30.230
- Yes, sir!
- Let go of me!

13:31.470 --> 13:32.830
Mr. Yu.

13:35.780 --> 13:37.210
Get a doctor.

13:37.230 --> 13:39.470
Mr. Yu, are you alright?

13:39.750 --> 13:41.110
Yes.

13:49.510 --> 13:50.870
Mr. Yu!

13:53.780 --> 13:55.140
Doctor,

13:55.630 --> 13:57.270
how is he?

13:58.080 --> 13:59.610
Fortunately, the treatment was timely.

13:59.630 --> 14:00.540
A moment later,

14:00.540 --> 14:01.990
even a miracle doctor

14:01.990 --> 14:03.790
couldn't have reversed this.

14:03.810 --> 14:05.510
Now, most of the toxin

14:05.510 --> 14:07.470
has been purged from his body.

14:08.060 --> 14:09.540
That's good.

14:09.710 --> 14:11.070
Thanks, doctor.

14:11.470 --> 14:12.990
But he can't be left unattended tonight.

14:12.990 --> 14:14.020
Call me

14:14.020 --> 14:15.540
at any sign of change.

14:15.590 --> 14:16.830
You come with me to the pharmacy

14:16.830 --> 14:18.990
to fetch antidote brews.

14:22.260 --> 14:23.510
Miss Jiang, would you...

14:23.510 --> 14:24.350
Don't worry.

14:24.350 --> 14:25.380
I'll stay

14:25.380 --> 14:26.870
and take care of him.

14:32.510 --> 14:33.870
Come on.

14:53.830 --> 14:55.700
(You think I'm the Saintness, )

14:56.160 --> 14:57.900
(but instead of killing me, )

14:58.380 --> 15:00.470
(you risked your life to save me.)

15:09.110 --> 15:10.630
You're awake.

15:13.830 --> 15:16.300
Thank you for taking care of me.

15:16.990 --> 15:20.180
You were injured because of me.

15:20.300 --> 15:22.510
If I don't even take care of you,

15:22.870 --> 15:25.060
I'd never live with myself.

15:25.590 --> 15:28.300
These minor injuries

15:28.660 --> 15:30.630
are part of the job for me.

15:31.510 --> 15:33.180
Please don't trouble yourself over it.

15:33.180 --> 15:34.880
This is no mere injury.

15:34.900 --> 15:36.810
The doctor just said

15:36.830 --> 15:38.280
if we had been a moment later,

15:38.300 --> 15:39.400
we would be

15:39.420 --> 15:41.180
holding your funeral now.

15:44.140 --> 15:45.540
Mr. Yu,

15:46.230 --> 15:48.180
I'm neither kin nor ally to you.

15:49.990 --> 15:52.150
Why did you risk your life for me?

15:58.020 --> 15:59.660
I didn't realize

15:59.660 --> 16:01.940
the arrow was poisoned.

16:02.870 --> 16:04.870
Miss Chi is also a stranger

16:04.870 --> 16:06.820
you met by chance.

16:07.180 --> 16:09.510
Didn't you risk your life for her?

16:11.300 --> 16:12.660
Yes.

16:12.780 --> 16:15.150
Who would have thought it was poisoned?

16:18.380 --> 16:19.630
I'll get you some water.

16:19.630 --> 16:20.670
Miss, I'll do it.

16:20.690 --> 16:22.150
Aman, let me do it.

16:24.870 --> 16:26.230
Miss Jiang.

16:26.900 --> 16:28.130
Mr. Zhen.

16:28.150 --> 16:29.320
Allow me

16:29.340 --> 16:30.700
to do it.

16:31.020 --> 16:32.380
Ok.

16:33.830 --> 16:35.660
What should we do?

16:35.660 --> 16:38.040
What can we do?

16:38.060 --> 16:40.610
Cao Xingyu is only imprisoned.

16:40.630 --> 16:42.590
His father will pull every string

16:42.590 --> 16:44.230
to exonerate him.

16:44.230 --> 16:46.370
If he is freed,

16:46.390 --> 16:47.260
our Qian

16:47.260 --> 16:49.160
will be thrown to the wolves again!

16:49.180 --> 16:51.140
Master, you must act now!

16:51.140 --> 16:53.060
Master!

16:53.340 --> 16:54.700
Mother.

16:54.990 --> 16:56.630
Mother.

16:56.710 --> 16:59.170
Mother, do something!

16:59.190 --> 17:00.750
Qian is the granddaughter you've cradled

17:00.750 --> 17:02.320
in your palms since her first breath.

17:02.340 --> 17:03.540
How can you stand idle

17:03.540 --> 17:06.900
and watch her walk to her death, Mother?

17:10.780 --> 17:12.210
Anmou,

17:12.230 --> 17:13.240
find a way.

17:13.240 --> 17:14.930
See if there's anyone reliable in the court

17:14.950 --> 17:17.870
we can turn to.

17:20.100 --> 17:21.590
Mother,

17:22.340 --> 17:23.370
Qian

17:23.390 --> 17:25.100
is the daughter I'm most proud of.

17:25.100 --> 17:26.840
How can I leave her alone?

17:26.860 --> 17:29.900
I went to visit them today,

17:29.950 --> 17:32.210
but they all refused to see me.

17:32.230 --> 17:33.430
I'm afraid they're too intimidated

17:33.430 --> 17:35.650
by Marquis Changxing's influence to help.

17:35.670 --> 17:36.930
But Mother,

17:36.950 --> 17:39.070
there will be a turning point.

17:39.340 --> 17:41.870
Attend to Mother so that she can rest.

17:42.620 --> 17:44.030
I'll take my leave.

17:44.390 --> 17:45.790
Master.

17:45.860 --> 17:47.080
Master.

17:47.100 --> 17:49.520
Master, don't leave.

17:49.540 --> 17:51.550
Don't leave.

18:01.260 --> 18:02.620
Mr. Yu.

18:02.990 --> 18:04.350
Mr. Yu,

18:05.340 --> 18:06.700
drink some water.

18:08.780 --> 18:09.970
Your hands are hurt.

18:09.990 --> 18:11.170
I'll feed you.

18:11.190 --> 18:13.310
My left hand is fine.

18:14.750 --> 18:16.660
Mr. Zhen,

18:17.230 --> 18:20.390
please put the cup next to me.

18:24.910 --> 18:26.210
So,

18:26.230 --> 18:27.630
how do you feel?

18:28.300 --> 18:31.590
I don't feel anything now.

18:33.430 --> 18:34.750
Have you found the evidence?

18:34.750 --> 18:36.310
All seized.

18:46.220 --> 18:48.260
Whenever I handle a case like this,

18:48.510 --> 18:50.070
I realize

18:50.640 --> 18:52.300
it's unimaginable

18:52.320 --> 18:54.200
how evil human nature is.

18:54.880 --> 18:55.920
I've handled

18:55.920 --> 18:57.880
so many cases,

18:58.120 --> 19:00.040
but I still

19:01.880 --> 19:03.520
can't get used to it.

19:03.840 --> 19:05.120
It is precisely

19:05.120 --> 19:06.380
your compassionate heart

19:06.400 --> 19:07.400
that drives

19:07.400 --> 19:08.860
your impartial justice.

19:08.880 --> 19:10.580
No innocent

19:10.600 --> 19:12.100
suffers unjustly.

19:12.120 --> 19:13.640
No guilty

19:13.640 --> 19:14.980
escapes unpunished.

19:15.000 --> 19:16.240
What you strive for

19:16.240 --> 19:17.960
is a conscience that remains clear.

19:18.080 --> 19:19.440
Miss Jiang.

19:20.000 --> 19:22.320
That's why the people

19:22.320 --> 19:24.620
need the Capital Security Office, Mr. Zhen,

19:24.640 --> 19:27.040
especially you.

19:28.080 --> 19:30.040
While the law cannot inspire goodness

19:30.040 --> 19:31.400
in people's hearts,

19:31.400 --> 19:33.620
it can deter them

19:33.640 --> 19:36.280
from acting

19:36.520 --> 19:37.740
on evil intentions,

19:37.760 --> 19:39.960
pulling them back from the brink.

19:40.080 --> 19:41.880
Mr. Yu has a point.

19:42.080 --> 19:43.440
Miss Jiang.

19:44.320 --> 19:46.720
But it doesn't work

19:46.840 --> 19:49.240
for some people.

19:50.080 --> 19:52.820
Because they're not human beings.

19:52.840 --> 19:55.000
They're animals.

19:55.560 --> 19:58.000
Mr. Yu, don't worry.

19:58.640 --> 20:00.920
The evidence won't get away,

20:01.000 --> 20:02.880
nor will Cao Xingyu.

20:03.000 --> 20:04.340
But, Mr. Zhen,

20:04.360 --> 20:05.820
we still need a backup plan.

20:05.840 --> 20:06.680
Marquis Changxing

20:06.680 --> 20:07.600
won't sit idle

20:07.600 --> 20:08.800
during his son's trial.

20:08.800 --> 20:10.000
He'll spare no effort

20:10.000 --> 20:11.140
to lobby the court,

20:11.160 --> 20:12.120
using every means

20:12.120 --> 20:13.560
to pressure you.

20:15.840 --> 20:17.500
Miss Jiang, I truly

20:17.520 --> 20:19.820
admire your insights.

20:19.840 --> 20:21.060
But please

20:21.080 --> 20:22.620
rest assured.

20:22.640 --> 20:24.100
No matter who

20:24.120 --> 20:25.960
tries to pressure us,

20:26.640 --> 20:28.400
we will never yield.

20:29.800 --> 20:33.760
I can assure you of that.

20:34.760 --> 20:36.120
He

20:36.360 --> 20:38.640
is as stubborn as a mule.

20:39.040 --> 20:40.140
Look,

20:40.160 --> 20:42.620
his wounds seem to be almost healed.

20:42.640 --> 20:44.720
Thanks for your compliment.

20:45.320 --> 20:46.660
How about this?

20:46.680 --> 20:48.020
Today,

20:48.040 --> 20:49.620
I will look after Mr. Yu.

20:49.640 --> 20:51.300
You were frightened during the day.

20:51.320 --> 20:53.040
Head back and get some rest.

20:53.840 --> 20:54.840
Long Dan went with the doctor

20:54.840 --> 20:56.160
to fetch the medicine just now.

20:56.160 --> 20:57.460
He should be back soon.

20:57.480 --> 20:58.600
I'd better stay here

20:58.600 --> 20:59.880
to brew Mr. Yu's herbal dose.

20:59.880 --> 21:00.900
No, no, no.

21:00.920 --> 21:02.480
It's not a big deal.

21:02.480 --> 21:03.660
Let Long Dan do it,

21:03.680 --> 21:05.260
or I'll do it.

21:05.280 --> 21:08.480
Miss Jiang should stay here.

21:08.600 --> 21:10.320
I've assigned Long Dan

21:10.320 --> 21:12.000
to other duties.

21:13.360 --> 21:15.200
Capital Security duties.

21:20.880 --> 21:24.200
How about I dispatch two constables?

21:26.320 --> 21:28.060
How can we let Miss Jiang

21:28.080 --> 21:30.040
take on such a grueling night shift?

21:35.040 --> 21:37.760
Since when did you learn

21:37.760 --> 21:39.760
to cherish the fairer sex?

21:40.840 --> 21:42.760
Thank you, Mr. Zhen.

21:43.000 --> 21:44.920
Mr. Yu, focus on your recovery.

21:44.920 --> 21:46.560
I'll return to visit you tomorrow.

21:47.520 --> 21:48.880
Miss Jiang,

21:49.080 --> 21:50.440
I'll walk you out.

21:50.560 --> 21:51.920
Ok.

21:59.600 --> 22:01.020
Please stay here, Mr. Zhen.

22:01.040 --> 22:03.000
You have to take care of Mr. Yu.

22:16.560 --> 22:17.900
Mr. Yu.

22:17.920 --> 22:19.280
Mr. Yu.

22:20.400 --> 22:22.280
Don't you find

22:22.400 --> 22:24.000
Miss Jiang

22:24.080 --> 22:24.920
truly unlike

22:24.920 --> 22:26.880
conventional ladies?

22:27.280 --> 22:28.640
Her radiant composure

22:28.640 --> 22:30.100
while arguing the case in court

22:30.120 --> 22:31.980
was striking.

22:32.000 --> 22:33.080
Also, she shows such loyalty

22:33.080 --> 22:35.200
and affection to her benefactor.

22:36.400 --> 22:37.760
Mr. Yu.

22:38.640 --> 22:40.000
Mr. Yu,

22:40.040 --> 22:41.880
did you hear what I said?

22:45.160 --> 22:46.680
If

22:47.560 --> 22:50.480
I had saved her from this arrow...

22:50.760 --> 22:53.400
- Then...
- Then we'll feast at your banquet.

22:55.080 --> 22:56.640
Banquet?

22:59.160 --> 23:01.340
If there's a banquet,

23:01.360 --> 23:03.200
it would be great.

23:07.920 --> 23:10.320
The Cao Family is unbelievable.

23:10.480 --> 23:13.320
Poor Qian's fate is so bitter.

23:15.640 --> 23:17.000
Shu,

23:17.320 --> 23:19.240
all my children

23:19.320 --> 23:20.960
are dear to me.

23:21.000 --> 23:22.900
(Concubine Ruan)
Qian is my daughter.

23:22.920 --> 23:25.000
I love her just as much.

23:26.080 --> 23:27.720
Don't take it to heart.

23:29.080 --> 23:31.000
I never thought

23:31.160 --> 23:32.360
things would

23:32.360 --> 23:34.240
turn out this way.

23:34.840 --> 23:36.960
I thought we should

23:37.080 --> 23:38.680
just put up with it,

23:38.920 --> 23:40.080
not expecting that wretch

23:40.080 --> 23:41.450
to twist it against us.

23:41.470 --> 23:42.320
Even though

23:42.320 --> 23:44.380
he's jailed now,

23:44.400 --> 23:47.200
we can't do anything about him.

23:47.360 --> 23:49.900
Should his father secure his release,

23:49.920 --> 23:51.640
Qian will

23:51.840 --> 23:53.780
suffer in the future.

23:53.800 --> 23:55.960
Even if that monster is released,

23:56.240 --> 23:58.460
as long as Qian stays away from him

23:58.480 --> 24:00.500
and you, me, Qiao, and Pei

24:00.520 --> 24:02.080
remain together as a family,

24:02.080 --> 24:03.880
nothing else matters.

24:06.000 --> 24:09.260
Master, he hasn't been released yet.

24:09.280 --> 24:11.060
We should believe that the wicked

24:11.080 --> 24:12.800
will get what's coming to them.

24:13.680 --> 24:15.160
Good point.

24:15.400 --> 24:16.760
Shu,

24:17.080 --> 24:18.960
in this family,

24:19.600 --> 24:20.480
you're the only one

24:20.480 --> 24:22.440
who can give me peace of mind.

24:45.560 --> 24:47.100
You and your daughter

24:47.120 --> 24:49.150
massacred my entire family,

24:49.170 --> 24:51.960
(The South)
drove me from Dazhou,

24:52.240 --> 24:54.500
then tracked me down to the South.

24:54.520 --> 24:56.920
Tonight is my wedding night.

24:57.560 --> 24:58.920
You are the Grand Princess,

24:58.920 --> 25:00.740
but just because your daughter

25:00.760 --> 25:02.240
covets my husband, you're making me

25:02.240 --> 25:04.460
write a letter of severance

25:04.480 --> 25:06.680
and jump off this cliff.

25:07.080 --> 25:09.190
Your relentless hunt

25:09.210 --> 25:10.760
will drown you in retribution!

25:10.760 --> 25:13.460
It's Yu Qi's honor

25:13.480 --> 25:15.320
to earn my daughter's favor.

25:16.120 --> 25:18.680
Whoever my daughter desires,

25:18.760 --> 25:21.480
I will ensure she gets him.

25:22.600 --> 25:23.660
Jiang Si,

25:23.680 --> 25:24.560
do you truly believe

25:24.560 --> 25:25.420
that a man in this world

25:25.430 --> 25:27.260
will only love you alone?

25:27.280 --> 25:29.920
Write the letter,

25:30.040 --> 25:31.800
and Yu Qi's heart

25:31.800 --> 25:33.480
will stray from you.

25:33.880 --> 25:36.140
His marriage to Mingyue

25:36.160 --> 25:38.280
is only a matter of time.

25:38.840 --> 25:40.670
You can forget about it.

25:40.690 --> 25:42.720
I'll never write it.

25:45.080 --> 25:46.440
Someone!

25:52.600 --> 25:53.820
Darling!

25:53.840 --> 25:55.320
Darling!

25:57.080 --> 25:58.580
What did you do to him?

25:58.600 --> 25:59.820
Let go of me!

25:59.840 --> 26:01.280
Don't hurt him!

26:01.280 --> 26:03.240
My next move

26:03.840 --> 26:06.000
depends entirely on your choice.

26:06.520 --> 26:08.060
As things stand now,

26:08.080 --> 26:10.340
you can only write the letter

26:10.360 --> 26:12.740
and leap from this cliff.

26:12.760 --> 26:15.960
Then I'll spare his life.

26:17.080 --> 26:18.800
Otherwise,

26:18.840 --> 26:20.520
I can take Yu Qi's life

26:20.640 --> 26:23.800
anytime, anywhere.

26:25.080 --> 26:26.800
Stop it!

26:26.840 --> 26:28.480
Stop it!

26:52.560 --> 26:56.780
(Yu Qi, through our days together...)

26:56.800 --> 26:58.240
Yu Qi,

26:58.680 --> 27:00.560
through our days together,

27:00.920 --> 27:03.960
I'm sorry for withholding my true heart.

27:04.840 --> 27:06.480
When we first met,

27:06.600 --> 27:09.660
adrift in this lonely place,

27:09.680 --> 27:12.000
I clung to you for refuge.

27:13.320 --> 27:15.680
But now I see clearly,

27:16.280 --> 27:18.640
there was never love in my heart.

27:20.240 --> 27:23.020
Thank you for your care and protection.

27:23.040 --> 27:24.920
Do not seek me.

27:25.600 --> 27:27.240
Let's

27:27.680 --> 27:29.960
go our separate ways.

27:31.320 --> 27:34.670
♪ A piercing ache lingers within ♪

27:34.670 --> 27:38.280
♪ Shattering the dreams ♪

27:38.300 --> 27:42.170
♪ How many petals fell, I count ♪

27:42.190 --> 27:45.950
♪ It equals the times I think about you ♪

27:46.000 --> 27:51.760
(Jiang Si)

27:52.730 --> 27:56.600
♪ I can't forget about you ♪

27:56.620 --> 27:59.700
♪ However long the road is ♪

27:59.700 --> 28:03.760
(Do not seek me. Let's go our separate ways.)

28:03.770 --> 28:10.370
♪ During my lifetime ♪

28:14.460 --> 28:18.000
♪ Can I still make it through the long night ♪

28:18.020 --> 28:21.660
♪ I fear that we'll part again ♪

28:21.730 --> 28:25.060
♪ A piercing ache lingers within ♪

28:25.080 --> 28:28.630
♪ Shattering the dreams ♪

28:28.650 --> 28:32.490
♪ I can't forget about you ♪

28:32.490 --> 28:36.140
♪ However long the road is ♪

28:38.120 --> 28:40.000
(If we could start over)

28:40.100 --> 28:42.560
(to undo all misfortunes, )

28:43.000 --> 28:44.820
(would we never)

28:44.840 --> 28:46.640
(have drifted apart)

28:47.320 --> 28:48.320
(or ended up)

28:48.320 --> 28:50.280
(like that?)

28:52.360 --> 28:55.040
Miss, your perilla drink is ready.

28:57.320 --> 28:58.680
Miss?

29:02.280 --> 29:03.140
Miss,

29:03.160 --> 29:05.620
are you worried about Mr. Yu?

29:05.640 --> 29:06.680
Didn't you say

29:06.680 --> 29:08.560
he was fine

29:08.640 --> 29:10.480
and he'd recover soon?

29:11.240 --> 29:15.200
Is it the so-called "care breeds confusion"?

29:16.800 --> 29:18.160
Aman,

29:20.080 --> 29:21.720
let me ask you something.

29:23.080 --> 29:27.240
If you have feelings for someone

29:29.400 --> 29:31.160
but know

29:32.280 --> 29:34.040
it might

29:35.280 --> 29:37.560
not end well

29:39.080 --> 29:40.800
because of misunderstandings

29:42.480 --> 29:43.960
or else...

29:47.560 --> 29:50.560
Anyway, it might not end well.

29:52.120 --> 29:54.040
Would you still

29:55.400 --> 29:57.040
choose to be with him?

29:59.400 --> 30:00.480
Only if

30:00.480 --> 30:02.720
I'm the one he loves.

30:05.480 --> 30:06.960
What if he loves you?

30:07.480 --> 30:08.840
Miss,

30:08.920 --> 30:11.720
did Mr. Yu express his feelings for you?

30:12.880 --> 30:14.960
I'm just asking.

30:16.840 --> 30:18.320
I'll take it as me.

30:19.560 --> 30:21.460
If it were me,

30:21.480 --> 30:23.100
I would be with him.

30:23.120 --> 30:24.600
In this fleeting life,

30:24.600 --> 30:26.740
mutual affection is a rarity.

30:26.760 --> 30:27.680
There are so many things

30:27.680 --> 30:28.680
in this world

30:28.680 --> 30:30.060
that we have to worry about.

30:30.080 --> 30:31.600
If we even have to

30:31.600 --> 30:33.300
worry about this,

30:33.320 --> 30:34.560
I'm afraid there won't be

30:34.560 --> 30:36.920
anything joyful in our lives.

30:50.160 --> 30:51.040
How did Xingyu

30:51.040 --> 30:52.920
end up in jail?

30:55.320 --> 30:57.320
Didn't you take care of everything?

30:58.880 --> 31:01.260
A witness came out of nowhere.

31:01.280 --> 31:03.320
How come?

31:04.000 --> 31:04.840
Is it...

31:04.840 --> 31:06.960
Don't worry about that.

31:07.280 --> 31:09.480
Doesn't the Capital Security want to dig?

31:09.840 --> 31:12.140
I'll silence the witness.

31:12.160 --> 31:14.120
Let's see how they proceed.

31:15.840 --> 31:17.980
When will Xingyu get out?

31:18.000 --> 31:18.880
He can't eat

31:18.880 --> 31:20.520
or sleep well in jail.

31:20.520 --> 31:21.400
He must be suffering.

31:21.400 --> 31:22.740
Enough!

31:22.760 --> 31:24.240
Womanly weakness.

31:31.320 --> 31:32.400
Where is the Golden and Jade

31:32.400 --> 31:34.620
I brought you

31:34.640 --> 31:36.000
from Lingnan?

31:53.080 --> 31:53.920
- Mr. Wu.
- Mr. Wu.

31:53.920 --> 31:55.380
- Hello, Mr. Wu.
- You've been working hard.

31:55.400 --> 31:56.320
Grab a bite.

31:56.320 --> 31:57.620
Thanks, Mr. Wu.

31:57.640 --> 31:59.000
Eat while it's hot.

32:01.080 --> 32:02.060
Help yourselves.

32:02.080 --> 32:03.440
- I'll get in first.
- Ok.

32:03.640 --> 32:05.000
Thanks.

32:16.080 --> 32:18.240
Miss Chi, I've brought you food.

32:19.760 --> 32:21.220
Thank you, sir.

32:21.240 --> 32:22.080
You must be starving.

32:22.080 --> 32:23.480
Have some food.

32:46.520 --> 32:48.720
Chief predicted it accurately.

32:48.760 --> 32:51.520
You are the mole within the Capital Security.

33:14.480 --> 33:17.480
(Morning Drizzle)

33:21.240 --> 33:22.600
Si.

33:22.800 --> 33:24.720
- Zhan.
- Where are you going?

33:24.760 --> 33:25.680
I'm going to see

33:25.680 --> 33:26.840
how Mr. Yu is recovering.

33:26.840 --> 33:27.680
Good timing.

33:27.680 --> 33:28.880
I'm also going to see

33:28.880 --> 33:29.880
how he is recovering.

33:29.880 --> 33:30.760
Let's go together.

33:30.760 --> 33:32.200
Ok, let's go.

33:34.760 --> 33:36.060
Sir,

33:36.080 --> 33:38.400
didn't we just visit Mr. Yu?

33:39.000 --> 33:40.760
How could I leave my sister

33:40.760 --> 33:42.960
alone with him?

33:43.080 --> 33:44.220
Besides,

33:44.240 --> 33:45.480
can't you smell how good the broth

33:45.480 --> 33:47.960
she is holding?

33:57.160 --> 33:58.220
Mr. Yu.

33:58.240 --> 33:59.260
Mr. Yu,

33:59.280 --> 34:00.960
this is the broth my sister made for you.

34:00.960 --> 34:02.400
Come on, try it.

34:02.400 --> 34:03.760
Thank you.

34:06.680 --> 34:08.040
Good.

34:13.560 --> 34:16.720
Broth shares the same spirit as wine,

34:16.800 --> 34:19.180
better shared than taken alone.

34:19.200 --> 34:20.720
Mr. Jiang, would you take the first sip?

34:20.720 --> 34:22.120
No, no, no.

34:22.590 --> 34:24.080
It's cooked specifically for your recovery.

34:24.080 --> 34:25.860
- It's ok.
- How could I share it?

34:25.880 --> 34:28.600
- Get me a bowl.
- But sharing this broth

34:28.600 --> 34:30.500
carries its own meaning.

34:30.520 --> 34:32.360
Mr. Yu, we have one more bowl.

34:32.560 --> 34:34.040
Look, there is.

34:34.040 --> 34:35.080
I'll help myself then.

34:35.080 --> 34:36.440
Go ahead.

34:44.200 --> 34:45.080
I've never had

34:45.080 --> 34:47.420
such a savory fish broth,

34:47.440 --> 34:48.760
not a hint

34:48.760 --> 34:49.780
of that fishy aftertaste.

34:49.800 --> 34:51.560
Mr. Yu, I don't mean to boast

34:51.560 --> 34:52.580
of my own sister,

34:52.600 --> 34:53.940
but this broth's

34:53.960 --> 34:54.800
layered flavors

34:54.800 --> 34:56.560
show real care.

34:56.560 --> 34:58.060
And my sister is thoughtful.

34:58.080 --> 34:59.520
Knowing your injury

34:59.520 --> 35:00.400
can't handle spice,

35:00.400 --> 35:02.060
she deliberately skipped the pepper.

35:02.080 --> 35:03.440
If...

35:03.480 --> 35:04.920
Do you have pepper?

35:06.680 --> 35:08.240
Come on.

35:10.640 --> 35:12.800
- Mr. Yu.
- Thank you.

35:14.080 --> 35:16.060
I didn't expect that Miss Jiang

35:16.080 --> 35:17.940
has put so much thought into it.

35:17.960 --> 35:19.380
I can't thank you enough

35:19.400 --> 35:22.040
- but
- No need for marriage proposals.

35:24.640 --> 35:27.500
repay you with more

35:27.520 --> 35:29.440
exquisite dishes.

35:29.560 --> 35:31.120
Eat it while it's hot.

35:43.520 --> 35:44.520
Take it easy.

35:44.520 --> 35:45.920
Don't choke on it.

35:49.000 --> 35:50.180
You've suffered

35:50.200 --> 35:51.720
because of me.

35:52.600 --> 35:53.680
When we

35:53.680 --> 35:54.600
get a chance

35:54.600 --> 35:56.060
to return to Ling'an,

35:56.080 --> 35:57.880
I'll make you all sorts of delicacies.

35:58.480 --> 35:59.440
Tell me

35:59.440 --> 36:00.360
what you'll make for me

36:00.360 --> 36:01.980
so I can imagine.

36:02.000 --> 36:03.720
Listen to this.

36:03.800 --> 36:05.280
Start by sourcing fresh crucian carp

36:05.280 --> 36:07.580
from Jinshui River.

36:07.600 --> 36:09.160
Coat the fish

36:09.160 --> 36:10.600
with egg white and rice wine

36:10.600 --> 36:11.740
to marinate,

36:11.760 --> 36:13.740
then pan-fry it in a heated wok

36:13.760 --> 36:15.860
until golden on both sides.

36:15.880 --> 36:17.840
Add ginger,

36:17.840 --> 36:19.580
dried tangerine peel, and other aromatics,

36:19.600 --> 36:21.580
simmering over low heat for two hours.

36:21.600 --> 36:23.700
You'll get tender flesh

36:23.720 --> 36:24.860
with crisp skin

36:24.880 --> 36:27.160
and a creamy white broth.

36:30.600 --> 36:32.040
Miss Jiang.

36:32.720 --> 36:34.160
Miss Jiang.

36:38.120 --> 36:40.760
My hands are still a bit clumsy.

36:40.760 --> 36:42.160
My pleasure.

36:44.480 --> 36:45.840
Thanks.

