37:09.960 --> 37:14.190
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

37:14.900 --> 37:17.300
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

37:17.320 --> 37:20.980
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

37:21.000 --> 37:24.420
♪ Growing between us ♪

37:24.570 --> 37:30.090
♪ And breeding love ♪

37:30.910 --> 37:34.590
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

37:34.590 --> 37:38.670
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

37:38.910 --> 37:40.650
♪ Like shadows ♪

37:40.670 --> 37:45.370
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

37:45.370 --> 37:48.940
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

37:48.960 --> 37:53.190
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

37:53.210 --> 37:54.990
♪ Time glows ♪

37:54.990 --> 37:59.530
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

37:59.550 --> 38:02.850
♪ And stars ♪

38:05.720 --> 38:07.060
You have a good eye, miss.

38:07.080 --> 38:09.200
It was Nie Yinniang's dagger once.

38:09.240 --> 38:10.180
Have a look.

38:10.200 --> 38:12.200
Genuine article, fair price. No tricks.

38:12.200 --> 38:13.520
You can trust me.

38:13.520 --> 38:14.900
I do have good taste.

38:14.920 --> 38:16.060
Sir, did it

38:16.080 --> 38:18.580
really belong to the famous female assassin?

38:18.600 --> 38:19.920
Sir, are you also interested in it?

38:19.920 --> 38:21.440
Miss, he...

38:23.600 --> 38:25.260
It's you.

38:25.280 --> 38:26.360
It's you.

38:26.360 --> 38:27.480
I was wondering

38:27.480 --> 38:28.560
how could anyone believe

38:28.560 --> 38:30.160
it was Nie Yinniang's dagger.

38:30.160 --> 38:31.900
You're snatching what I claimed,

38:31.920 --> 38:33.400
just to spite me.

38:33.520 --> 38:34.500
Sir,

38:34.520 --> 38:36.080
- I saw this dagger first.
- Yes.

38:36.080 --> 38:37.160
How much? I'll take it.

38:37.160 --> 38:38.600
50 taels of silver. Fair price.

38:38.600 --> 38:40.140
I'll pay you 60.

38:40.160 --> 38:41.700
- 60 is good.
- 70.

38:41.720 --> 38:42.600
- Miss.
- 100 for this,

38:42.600 --> 38:44.120
and I'll take more items!

38:45.360 --> 38:46.720
Then you...

38:47.560 --> 38:48.680
Could you tell me about this?

38:48.680 --> 38:50.340
Sir, you've got a sharp eye.

38:50.340 --> 38:51.680
This is the legendary Twelve Hours Dial

38:51.680 --> 38:53.960
from the Tang Dynasty's palace treasury.

38:53.960 --> 38:55.280
Observe how each hour

38:55.280 --> 38:56.500
corresponds to a zodiac animal.

38:56.520 --> 38:57.920
Twelve Hours Dial, right?

38:57.920 --> 39:00.580
Exactly, the sole surviving piece.

39:00.600 --> 39:01.540
Would you

39:01.560 --> 39:03.080
count the hours for me?

39:03.440 --> 39:04.440
You don't have to.

39:04.440 --> 39:05.920
It's just used to check the time,

39:05.920 --> 39:06.950
isn't it?

39:06.970 --> 39:07.860
Sir.

39:07.880 --> 39:08.740
11.

39:08.760 --> 39:11.240
So, this is...

39:15.640 --> 39:17.000
There is more!

39:17.080 --> 39:19.340
Sir, is this...

39:19.360 --> 39:20.680
It's the last stone left

39:20.680 --> 39:22.160
when Nuwa

39:22.160 --> 39:23.660
mended the sky.

39:23.680 --> 39:24.730
Yeah.

39:24.750 --> 39:26.280
What do you think of this stone?

39:29.400 --> 39:30.620
Why do I have a feeling

39:30.640 --> 39:31.520
that he is a fraud?

39:31.520 --> 39:33.120
You just realized that?

39:34.280 --> 39:35.280
He is a fraud, indeed.

39:35.280 --> 39:36.220
What's wrong?

39:36.220 --> 39:37.590
After looking for so long, at least buy one!

39:37.590 --> 39:38.720
Is Nie Yinniang's dagger also a fake?

39:38.720 --> 39:39.600
How could there be a dagger

39:39.600 --> 39:41.360
used by Nie Yinniang?

39:43.280 --> 39:44.900
You're pretty good.

39:44.920 --> 39:46.360
You can tell it's fake.

39:47.240 --> 39:48.440
Everyone on the street knows it

39:48.440 --> 39:49.800
except you.

39:51.280 --> 39:53.640
To thank you for your help,

39:53.880 --> 39:55.240
I'm returning this to you.

39:55.720 --> 39:57.080
Really?

39:57.200 --> 39:58.560
Then you...

39:58.720 --> 40:00.160
I've made some money,

40:00.160 --> 40:01.800
so I'll pay you back first.

40:02.400 --> 40:04.560
My precious money is back.

40:04.760 --> 40:06.720
Come on, I'll treat you to a meal.

40:06.760 --> 40:08.740
Great!

40:08.760 --> 40:12.320
(Guangju Restaurant)
- Great! - Great!

40:20.200 --> 40:21.840
I don't have enough money

40:22.400 --> 40:24.760
to feed you alone.

40:25.920 --> 40:30.060
My precious money!

40:30.080 --> 40:31.440
You have some too.

40:34.520 --> 40:35.920
Try this.

40:39.520 --> 40:42.720
- Splendid!
- Bravo!

40:43.200 --> 40:45.840
- Good!
- Perfect!

40:46.680 --> 40:48.240
Today's tales of the extraordinary

40:48.240 --> 40:50.080
turn our gaze to the ill-omened soul,

40:50.080 --> 40:52.080
the 7th Prince.

40:52.480 --> 40:53.940
Do you still recall the chaos

40:53.960 --> 40:56.720
that gripped our borders two decades ago?

40:56.920 --> 40:58.720
At a moonless, windswept night,

40:58.720 --> 41:00.600
Nanwu raiders launched a large-scale attack

41:00.600 --> 41:02.370
on Dazhou without any warning.

41:02.390 --> 41:04.420
Our troops were caught off guard

41:04.430 --> 41:06.580
and slaughtered.

41:06.600 --> 41:08.280
Yet at the same night,

41:08.290 --> 41:10.720
the 7th Prince

41:11.730 --> 41:13.390
was born.

41:13.440 --> 41:15.620
What jubilation echoed through the palace!

41:15.640 --> 41:18.440
However, when the bitter news

41:18.440 --> 41:20.580
of defeat reached Ling'an,

41:20.600 --> 41:21.960
everything

41:23.960 --> 41:25.220
changed.

41:25.240 --> 41:27.140
What happened to the prince again?

41:27.160 --> 41:29.600
Stop, or Nanwu people will take you away.

41:31.240 --> 41:33.260
As storm clouds gathered,

41:33.280 --> 41:35.660
the Directorate of Astronomy stated

41:35.680 --> 41:38.400
that the 7th Prince was a jinx

41:38.400 --> 41:39.680
and his birth

41:39.680 --> 41:41.780
unleashed the border warfare.

41:41.800 --> 41:43.240
Late at night,

41:43.600 --> 41:46.960
ministers knelt and refused to get up,

41:46.960 --> 41:50.220
pleading with the Emperor to eliminate

41:50.240 --> 41:53.740
the prince for his country.

41:53.760 --> 41:55.540
Wasn't he just born?

41:55.560 --> 41:57.020
In the end,

41:57.040 --> 41:58.080
the Emperor relented.

41:58.080 --> 42:00.640
He dispatched the swaddled 7th Prince

42:00.640 --> 42:02.080
to the southern borderlands.

42:02.080 --> 42:03.600
Should he live, let fate decide.

42:03.600 --> 42:04.440
Should he die,

42:04.450 --> 42:06.440
consider it solace for the fallen warriors.

42:06.440 --> 42:09.720
Thus were the grumbling masses appeased.

42:10.000 --> 42:12.620
But mark this!

42:12.640 --> 42:14.060
From then on,

42:14.080 --> 42:16.680
Dazhou has never won another victory,

42:16.680 --> 42:19.760
and has ceded territory after territory,

42:20.040 --> 42:21.000
all because

42:21.000 --> 42:22.540
the ill-omened 7th Prince

42:22.560 --> 42:25.200
remained in the ranks.

42:26.080 --> 42:27.440
- Yes.
- Exactly.

42:27.440 --> 42:29.000
- Exactly.
- That's right.

42:29.480 --> 42:31.600
This unlucky 7th Prince...

42:31.830 --> 42:32.680
Who is it?

42:32.680 --> 42:33.880
What's going on?

42:33.880 --> 42:35.720
- Who is it?
- Who?

42:36.040 --> 42:37.260
- What are you doing?
- Any manners?

42:37.280 --> 42:39.020
How dare you spout baseless lies?

42:39.040 --> 42:40.200
I'll shut your filthy mouth for good!

42:40.200 --> 42:41.920
Spare me! I'm just scraping by!

42:41.920 --> 42:43.280
Chuchu?

42:43.680 --> 42:44.830
Long Dan?

42:44.850 --> 42:46.330
What's your problem?

42:48.400 --> 42:49.450
We were listening just fine!

42:49.450 --> 42:50.360
Exactly.

42:50.360 --> 42:53.960
(The End of Episode 6)

